## API Authentication Key
## This key must match the APP_CHAT_KEY from the backend configuration
## Used for authenticating chat requests to the backend API (server-side only)
NEXT_PRIVATE_CHAT_API_KEY="<YOUR_CHAT_API_KEY>"

## Backend API URL
## For production deployment: https://YOUR_DOMAIN:8443
## Backend runs on port 8443 with HTTPS using Let's Encrypt certificates
## Example: https://api.example.com:8443
NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL="<YOUR_BACKEND_URL>"
